  "description": "Tell Zurghul is an archaeological site in Iraq covering approximately 70 ha. The site includes two settlement mounds. The ancient site was located on a canal leading away from Lagash, some 10 km to the southeast. The ancient name of this place was Ni\u011din (or Nina or Ninua), and Nanshe (Nan\u0161e) was the titular divinity.",
